<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Kani Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Kani Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		     Kani Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			 KANI.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $10-$12/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    1.4 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 1.4 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    4.0 million</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Joseph Charles &amp; Associates Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  210,000 shrs Business: Company is based in Mahattan Beach, Calif. Recently formed with exclusive right to market and sell products under Kani brand name pursuant to license from Carl Williams. The Kani company designs, develops, markets and distibrutes footwear bearing Kani brand name. Use of Proceeds: to advertise Kani brand name, secure athletic endorsements of company's products and establish concept shops for the distribution of the company's products. Also for working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>				   1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $18,063	    $19,884</p>
<p>   - Net Income		 $751	     $3,323</p>
